isk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#wizard-steps","content":"`--plan` (and `--json`) print **stderr progress immediately**: start banner, `df`, each allowed root as it is scanned, a heartbeat on large trees, Docker `system df`, then ranking. A full Spark (`~/.cache`, `/tmp`, Docker) can still take a while — it will not sit silent. `--json` keeps a single JSON array on **stdout**; progress stays on stderr. Heartbeat interval: `DISK_WIZARD_PROGRESS_INTERVAL` seconds (default `2`; `0` disables in-root heartbeats, not the per-root lines)."},"210":{"id":"/disk-wizard-46","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#what-a-row-means","content":"Field"},"211":{"id":"/disk-wizard-47","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#what-a-row-means","content":"Meaning"},"212":{"id":"/disk-wizard-48","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#what-a-row-means","content":"**what**"},"213":{"id":"/disk-wizard-49","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#what-a-row-means","content":"What this file or Docker object is"},"214":{"id":"/disk-wizard-50","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#what-a-row-means","content":"**why**"},"215":{"id":"/disk-wizard-51","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#what-a-row-means","content":"Why it exists on a Spark used for mixed inference experiments"},"216":{"id":"/disk-wizard-52","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","u