,"page_id":"/download-limit","type":"heading","tags":["bandwidth","wondershaper","speedtest","safety"],"url":"/download-limit#units","content":"Units"},"253":{"id":"/download-limit-11","page_id":"/download-limit","type":"heading","tags":["bandwidth","wondershaper","speedtest","safety"],"url":"/download-limit#advanced","content":"Advanced"},"254":{"id":"/download-limit-12","page_id":"/download-limit","tags":["bandwidth","wondershaper","speedtest","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/download-limit#download-limit","content":"**What's on this page**"},"255":{"id":"/download-limit-13","page_id":"/download-limit","tags":["bandwidth","wondershaper","speedtest","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/download-limit#download-limit","content":"Why bandwidth limits matter on remote Sparks"},"256":{"id":"/download-limit-14","page_id":"/download-limit","tags":["bandwidth","wondershaper","speedtest","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/download-limit#download-limit","content":"CLI usage (`status`, `run`, `clear`, `wrap`, `--refresh`)"},"257":{"id":"/download-limit-15","page_id":"/download-limit","tags":["bandwidth","wondershaper","speedtest","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/download-limit#download-limit","content":"Manual Mbps cap (`download-models --limit N`) vs auto"},"258":{"id":"/download-limit-16","page_id":"/download-limit","tags":["bandwidth","wondershaper","speedtest","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/download-limit#download-limit","content":"Auto mode (85% of a duration HTTP / speedtest sample, cached 24h) and wrap lifecycle"},"259":{"id":"/download-limit-17","page_id":"/download-limit","tags":["bandwidth","wondershaper","speedtest","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/download-limit#download-limit","content":"**What this enables**"},"260":{"id":"/download-limit-18","page_id":"/download-limit","tags":["bandwidth","wondershaper","speedtest","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/download-limit#download-limit","content":"Downloading multi‑GB Klein/Wan/LTX weights without saturating the uplink and freezing SSH"},"261":{"id":"/download-limit-19","page_id":"/download-limit","tags":["bandwidth","wondershaper","speedtest","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/download-limit#why","content":"You cannot walk over to a Spark and wiggle the HDMI cable. Bandwidth left for SSH is how you recover a host that is pulling 30 GB of LTX. A full-rate Hugging Face pull can starve interactive SSH. This utility applies kernel-level traffic shaping via **wondershaper** when HTB is available, and falls back to gentler HF client settings when it is not. Wrap **always clears on exit** — do not weaken that."},"262":{"id":"/download-limit-20","page_id":"/download-limit","tags":["bandwidth","wondershaper","speedtest","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/download-limit#why","content":"Inspired by the throttled Ollama downloader in `dgx-spark-it-up`, generalized and improved with **auto** limiting."},"263":{"id":"/download-limit-21","page_id":"/download-limit","tags":["bandwidth","wondershaper","speedtest","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/download-limit#commands","content":"Command"},"264":{"id":"/download-limit-22","page_id":"/download-limit","tags":["bandwidth","wondershaper","speedtest","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/download-limit#commands","content":"Purpose"},"265":{"id":"/download-limit-23","page_id":"/download-limit","tags":["bandwidth","wondershaper","speedtest","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/download-limit#commands","content":"`status [--json] [--refresh]`"},"266":{"id":"/download-limit-24","page_id":"/download-limit","tags":["bandwidth","wondershaper","speedtest","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/download-limit#commands","content":"Report interface + speed cache; `--refresh` remasures"},"267":{"id":"/download-limit-25","page_id":"/download-limit","tags":["bandwidth","wondershaper","speedtest","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/download-limit#commands","content":"`run --limit 50`"},"268":{"id":"/download-limit-26","page_id":"/download-limit","tags":["bandwidth","wondershaper","speedtest","safety"],"t