. It is not `occupancy enter llm`. Mode × legal GPU jobs: Occupancy matrix."},"1077":{"id":"/occupancy-55","page_id":"/occupancy","tags":["occupancy","blender","trellis","safety","gb10"],"type":"text","url":"/occupancy#modes","content":"One-time 35B pull (throttled; **not** `download-models`):"},"1078":{"id":"/occupancy-56","page_id":"/occupancy","tags":["occupancy","blender","trellis","safety","gb10"],"type":"text","url":"/occupancy#modes","content":"Host `llama-server` must be on `PATH` (aarch64). Missing binary prints a host-install hint and exits 1 — do not apt/pip inside Docker. vLLM + `nvidia/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-NVFP4` is an operator alternative only (not wired). Path D: `ssh -L 30000:127.0.0.1:30000`."},"1079":{"id":"/occupancy-57","page_id":"/occupancy","tags":["occupancy","blender","trellis","safety","gb10"],"type":"text","url":"/occupancy#modes","content":"`occupancy enter` **does not** start Compose. Heavy modes tell you to `./scripts/manage.sh start` (type **yes**) when the container is down."},"1080":{"id":"/occupancy-58","page_id":"/occupancy","tags":["occupancy","blender","trellis","safety","gb10"],"type":"text","url":"/occupancy#modes","content":"State lives at `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}/.occupancy.json` (outputs, never `MODELS_DIR`). In-canvas **Occupancy gate** (`EZDCCOccupancyGate`) reads that file only — it does not start Compose or spawn Blender. Stay in Comfy after a Blender dump."},"1081":{"id":"/occupancy-59","page_id":"/occupancy","tags":["occupancy","blender","trellis","safety","gb10"],"type":"text","url":"/occupancy#park-vs-stop","content":"`stop` is the hammer: container down, volumes kept. Use it for NVENC proxies, SuperSplat, or a wedged UI."},"1082":{"id":"/occupancy-60","page_id":"/occupancy","tags":["occupancy","blender","trellis","safety","gb10"],"type":"text","url":"/occupancy#park-vs-stop","content":"`occupancy enter blender-desk` keeps Compose up, waits for an empty queue, then `POST /free` `{unload_models, free_memory}` (the Manager unload). Host Workbench dumps (`export-guides`, `blender-stills`, `house-views`, `blender`) are allowed. NVENC still dies if compose is up."},"1083":{"id":"/occupancy-61","page_id":"/occupancy","tags":["occupancy","blender","trellis","safety","gb10"],"type":"text","url":"/occupancy#park-vs-stop","content":"If `/free` fails, Workbench may still contend for unified memory — `occupancy idle` then."},"1084":{"id":"/occupancy-62","page_id":"/occupancy","tags":["occupancy","blender","trellis","safety","gb10"],"type":"text","url":"/occupancy#what-this-is-not","content":"Not a Compose profile for Blender (Blender stays a host binary)"},"1085":{"id":"/occupancy-63","page_id":"/occupancy","tags":["occupancy","blender","trellis","safety","gb10"],"type":"text","url":"/occupancy#what-this-is-not","content":"Not Cycles GPU / OptiX while Compose is up"},"1086":{"id":"/occupancy-64","page_id":"/occupancy","tags":["occupancy","blender","trellis","safety","gb10"],"type":"text","url":"/occupancy#what-this-is-not","content":"Not lowering `mem_limit: 90g` or `min_host_free_gib: 28`"},"1087":{"id":"/occupancy-65","page_id":"/occupancy","tags":["occupancy","blender","trellis","safety","gb10"],"type":"text","url":"/occupancy#what-this-is-not","content":"Not two denoises (Klein + LTX, TRELLIS + LTX, Wan + TRELLIS)"},"1088":{"id":"/occupancy-66","page_id":"/occupancy","tags":["occupancy","blender","trellis","safety","gb10"],"type":"text","url":"/occupancy#what-this-is-not","content":"Not `occupancy enter llm` (graph label only). Use `llm-desk` for the 35B sidecar."},"1089":{"id":"/occupancy-67","page_id":"/occupancy","tags":["occupancy","blender","trellis","safety","gb10"],"type":"text","url":"/occupancy#mcp-mcp-construct","content":"Tool tables and Path D tunnels: MCP."},"1090":{"id":"/occupancy-68","page_id":"/occupancy","tags":["occupancy","blender","trellis","safety","gb10"],"type":"text","url":"/occupancy#mcp-mcp-construct","content":"In-tree MCP servers are typed-tool stdio processes. **No** `execute_code`, **no** telemetry. Official Comfy Cloud MCP / `comfy-mcp` stay out of the image (`manage.sh start` is the launch path). **studio-mcp** clones `_lab` graphs into `_user/` and does **not** Queue."},"1091":{"id":"/occupancy-69","page_id":"/occupancy","tags":["occupancy","blender","trellis","safety","gb10"],"type":"text","url":"/occupancy#mcp-mcp-construct","content":"**blender-mcp** wraps occupancy and host Blender (primitives, camera, keyframes, GLB, guide dumps). **No** cloud 3D APIs. bpy tools need blender-desk."},"1092":{"id":"/occupancy-70","page_id":"/occupancy","tags":["occupancy","blender","trellis","safety","gb10"],"type":"text","url":"/occupancy#mcp-mcp-construct","content":"Qwen3-4B will place primitives. Cinematic scenes: Path D — laptop Grok/Cursor as the MCP client over SSH, Spark only runs blender-mcp. If `llama-cli` is missing, `blender-llm` prints that hint and exits 1."},"1093":{"id":"/occupancy-71","page_id":"/occupancy","tags":["occupancy","blender","trellis","safety","gb10"],"type":"text","url":"/occupancy#mcp-mcp-construct","content":"**research-mcp** is the creative-process desk (chat, web search, sequential research subagents, `list_lab_apps` / `describe_app`). Graph occupancy **llm**: GPU 35B sidecar when `llm-desk` is up (`http://127.0.0.1:30000/v1` on the host; `host.docker.internal` from Comfy). CPU 4B only if the sidecar is down or occupancy is Wan/LTX/TRELLIS. It does **not** refuse a GPU Comfy session and does **not** map `idle` → `blender-desk` or `llm-desk`. Same pipeline as **inspire/research-chat**. HTTPS search is SSRF-guarded (no arbitrary `fetch_url` tool)."},"1094":{"id":"/occupancy-72","page_id":"/occupancy","tags":["occupancy","blender","trellis","safety","gb10"],"type":"text","url":"/occupancy#mcp-mcp-construct","content":"Path D: laptop agent is the MCP client; Spark runs `research-mcp`. Briefs land under `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}/research/` (never `MODELS_DIR`). Copy prompt ingredients into Prompt Forge, then Spark Still. MCP does not Queue Comfy."},"1095":{"id":"/occupancy-73","page_id":"/occupancy","tags":["occupancy","blender","trellis","safety","gb10"],"type":"text","url":"/occupancy#mcp-mcp-construct","content":"**studio-mcp** is the App Forge desk (search/clone/stamp lab graphs into live `_user/`). Graph occupancy **llm**. Same GGUF / sidecar rules as research-mcp. Does **not** Queue the cloned graph. Open `_user/<slug>` and Queue under the **source** occupancy (klein / wan / ltx / …)."},"1096":{"id":"/occupancy-74","page_id":"/occupancy","tags":["occupancy","blender","trellis","safety","gb10"],"type":"text","url":"/occupancy#mcp-mcp-construct","content":"Related: Occupancy matrix · MCP · ComfyUI Apps · Blender GB10 sidecar · Studio sidecars · Hardware, memory, and safety · Architecture · Troubleshooting — studio canvas."},"1097":{"id":"/podcast","page_id":"/podcast","type":"page","content":"Local podcast","breadcrumbs":["Docs"],"tags":["podcast","kokoro","ace-step","tts","disclosure","us-safe"],"url":"/podcast"},"1098":{"id":"/podcast-0","page_id":"/podcast","tags":["podcast","kokoro","ace-step","tts","disclosure","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/podcast","content":"US-safe two-host, radio-drama, and learning-episode lanes on one DGX Spark (Kokoro + native ACE-Step)."},"1099":{"id":"/podcast-1","page_id":"/podcast","type":"heading","tags":["podcast","kokoro","ace-step","tts","disclosure","us-safe"],"url":"/podcast#local-podcast","content":"Local podcast"},"1100":{"id":"/podcast-2","page_id":"/podcast","type":"heading","tags":["podcast","kokoro","ace-step","tts","disclosure","us-safe"],"url":"/podcast#three-operator-paths","content":"Three operator paths"},"1101":{"id":"/podcast-3","page_id":"/podcast","type":"heading","tags":["podcast","kokoro","ace-step","tts","disclosure","us-safe"],"url":"/podcast#option-a--two-host-episode-commercial-episode","content":"Option A — two-host-episode commercial episode"},"1102":{"id":"/podcast-4","page_id":"/podcast","type":"heading"