content":"Parallel shorts / concat-shots"},"1534":{"id":"/spark-farm-40","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#farm-vs-relay","content":"**Do not implement**"},"1535":{"id":"/spark-farm-41","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#farm-vs-relay","content":"NCCL split of a single denoise across 3 GB10s"},"1536":{"id":"/spark-farm-42","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#farm-vs-relay","content":"Out of scope"},"1537":{"id":"/spark-farm-43","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#farm-vs-relay","content":"Clustering is **throughput + one weight copy**, not slicing one sampler. MiniMax H3 is banned — see licenses."},"1538":{"id":"/spark-farm-44","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#networking-docs-only--no-iac","content":"Physical: 3 Sparks, high-bandwidth already up."},"1539":{"id":"/spark-farm-45","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#networking-docs-only--no-iac","content":"**3-node ring:** 3× QSFP DAC, both CX-7 ports live. NVIDIA Sync → Cluster Assistant. No switch."},"1540":{"id":"/spark-farm-46","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#networking-docs-only--no-iac","content":"**Star via QSFP switch:** each Spark one or two 200 GbE links."},"1541":{"id":"/spark-farm-47","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#networking-docs-only--no-iac","content":"Management SSH stays on 10 GbE / RJ45. Model sync uses **`SPARK_FABRIC_IPS` only**. Do not rsync multi-gig weights over the management NIC."},"1542":{"id":"/spark-farm-48","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],