 banned (see licenses)."},"1550":{"id":"/spark-farm-56","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#per-node-process","content":"`spark-farm.sh` **never** starts compose remotely. It prints the exact `./scripts/manage.sh start` you must run locally (heavy confirm stays on that node). Containers still use `restart: \"no\"`."},"1551":{"id":"/spark-farm-57","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#per-node-process","content":"The `run` subcommand prints a **films/go-see / motion/silent/still-to-shot / motion/av/still-to-shot** Queue reminder for `--film go-see` (or still-here / switchyard). It does **not** POST graphs. It refuses MiniMax H3 names (`*h3*` / `*MiniMax*`)."},"1552":{"id":"/spark-farm-58","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#per-node-process","content":"`dispatch` assigns shots **01–06 / 07–12 / 13–18** (or an even split on two hosts) and SSH-runs **local** `./scripts/manage.sh print-shot` on each Spark. It **never** remote-starts compose. Director is off this path. Concat on spark-0 after gather."},"1553":{"id":"/spark-farm-59","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#per-node-process","content":"Memory: keep `MEM_LIMIT=90g`, `MEM_RESERVATION=80g`, `MIN_HOST_FREE_GIB=28`, `shm_size: 16gb`."},"1554":{"id":"/spark-farm-60","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#commands","content":"Start compose yourself on each node (`./scripts/manage.sh start`, type yes). Then dispatch."},"1555":{"id":"/splat-sidecar","page_id":"/splat-sidecar","type":"page","content":"Splat sidecar","breadcrumbs":["Docs"],"tags":["splat","supersplat","sidecar","occupancy"],"url":"/splat-sidecar"},"1556":{"id":"/splat-sidecar-0","page_id":"/splat-sidecar","tags":["splat","supersplat","sidecar","occupancy"],"type":"text","url":"/splat-sidecar","content":"SuperSplat MIT host viewer for Gaussian splats. Not in the Dockerfile. Occupancy with Comfy."},"1557":{"id":"/splat-sidecar-1","page_id":"/splat-sidecar","type":"heading","tags":["splat","supersplat","sidecar","occupancy"],"url":"/splat-sidecar#splat-sidecar","content":"Splat sidecar"},"1558":{"id":"/splat-sidecar-2","page_id":"/splat-sidecar","type":"heading","tags":["splat","supersplat","sidecar","occupancy"],"url":"/splat-sidecar#operator-path","content":"Operator path"},"1559":{"id":"/splat-sidecar-3","page_id":"/splat-sidecar","tags":["splat","supersplat","sidecar","occupancy"],"type":"text","url":"/splat-sidecar#splat-sidecar","content":"**What's on this page**"},"1560":{"id":"/splat-sidecar-4","page_id":"/splat-sidecar","tags":["splat","supersplat","sidecar","occupancy"],"type":"text","url":"/splat-sidecar#splat-sidecar","content":"SuperSplat as a **host** static viewer (MIT)"},"1561":{"id":"/splat-sidecar-5","page_id":"/splat-sidecar","tags":["splat","supersplat","sidecar","occupancy"],"type":"text","url":"/splat-sidecar#splat-sidecar","content":"Why it is not in `docker/Dockerfile`"},"1562":{"id":"/splat-sidecar-6","page_id":"/splat-sidecar","tags":["splat","supersplat","sidecar","occupancy"],"type":"text","url":"/splat-sidecar#splat-sidecar","content":"Occupancy with Comfy / TRELLIS"},"1563":{"id":"/splat-sidecar-7","page_id":"/splat-sidecar","tags":["splat","supersplat","sidecar","occupancy"],"type":"text","url":"/splat-sidecar#splat-sidecar","content":"**What this enables**"},"1564":{"id":"/splat-sidecar-8","page_id":"/splat-sidecar","tags":["splat","supersplat","sidecar","occupancy"],"type":"text","url":"/splat-sidecar#splat-sidecar","content":"Inspecting a splat on the Spark without baking a viewer into the Comfy image"},"1565":{"id":"/splat-sidecar-9","page_id":"/splat-sidecar","tags":["splat","supersplat","sidecar","occupancy"],"type":"text","url":"/splat-sidecar#splat-sidecar","content":"Keeping Pixal3D / Inria 3DGS **out** of the default pack"},"1566":{"id":"/splat-sidecar-10","page_id":"/splat-sidecar","tags":["splat","supersplat","sidecar","occupancy"],"type":"text","url":"/splat-sidecar#splat-sidecar","content":"SuperSplat (`playcanvas/supersplat`, MIT) is a static viewer you run on the host. It is **not** cloned into this MIT tree, **not** a Compose service, and **not** a `manage.sh` verb."},"1567":{"id":"/splat-sidecar-11","page_id":"/splat-sidecar","tags":["splat","supersplat","sidecar","occupancy"],"type":"text","url":"/splat-sidecar#operator-path","content":"`./scripts/manage.sh stop` — encoder / GPU occupancy"},"1568":{"id":"/splat-sidecar-12","page_id":"/splat-sidecar","tags":["splat","supersplat","sidecar","occupancy"],"type":"text","url":"/splat-sidecar#operator-path","content":"Open SuperSplat on the host (upstream release or local static build)"},"1569":{"id":"/splat-sidecar-13","page_id":"/splat-sidecar","tags":["splat","supersplat","sidecar","occupancy"],"type":"text","url":"/splat-sidecar#operator-path","content":"Load the splat file from disk. Do not point it at the Comfy volume as a live mount while compose is up"},"1570":{"id":"/splat-sidecar-14","page_id":"/splat-sidecar","tags":["splat","supersplat","sidecar","occupancy"],"type":"text","url":"/splat-sidecar#operator-path","content":"TripoSR / TripoSplat weights remain an opt-in manifest pack (`triposplat`) and are **not** a default. `--drop-pack triposplat` cannot eat `flux2-vae`."},"1571":{"id":"/splat-sidecar-15","page_id":"/splat-sidecar","tags":["splat","supersplat","sidecar","occupancy"],"type":"text","url":"/splat-sidecar#operator-path","content":"Banned as defaults: Inria 3DGS, Pixal3D-as-default, nvdiffrast TRELLIS. See Model licenses."},"1572":{"id":"/splat-sidecar-16","page_id":"/splat-sidecar","tags":["splat","supersplat","sidecar","occupancy"],"type":"text","url":"/splat-sidecar#operator-path","content":"Related: Studio sidecars · Blender GB10 sidecar."},"1573":{"id":"/studio-apps","page_id":"/studio-apps","type":"page","content":"ComfyUI Apps","breadcrumbs":["Docs"],"tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"url":"/studio-apps"},"1574":{"id":"/studio-apps-0","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps","content":"App Mode surfaces for the US-safe studio — Lane A Inspire vs Lane B Produce, occupancy, and handoff chains."},"1575":{"id":"/studio-apps-1","page_id":"/studio-apps","type":"heading","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"ComfyUI Apps"},"1576":{"id":"/studio-apps-2","page_id":"/studio-apps","type":"heading","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"Graph vs App"},"1577":{"id":"/studio-apps-3","page_id":"/studio-apps","type":"heading","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"url":"/studio-apps#occupancy","content":"Occupancy"},"1578":{"id":"/studio-apps-4","page_id":"/studio-apps","type":"heading","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"url":"/studio-apps#lane-a--inspire","content":"Lane A — Inspire"},"1579":{"id":"/studio-apps-5","page_id":"/studio-apps","type":"heading","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"url":"/studio-apps#lane-b--produce","content":"Lane B — Produce"},"1580":{"id":"/studio-apps-6","page_id":"/studio-apps","type":"heading","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"url":"/studio-apps#lane-dcc--clay-desk","content":"Lane DCC — clay desk"},"1581":{"id":"/studio-apps-7","page_id":"/studio-apps","type":"heading","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"url":"/studio-apps#handoff-chains","content":"Handoff chains"},"1582":{"id":"/studio-apps-8","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"**What's on this page**"},"1583":{"id":"/studio-apps-9","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"How App Mode relates to the node graph"},"1584":{"id":"/studio-apps-10","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"Apps sidebar (`.app.json`) vs Workflows"},"1585":{"id":"/studio-apps-11","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"Where operator Apps persist (`_user/`, rescue from `_lab/`)"},"1586":{"id":"/studio-apps-12","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"Creator widgets: Quality (Lab / Draft / High / Free Commercial Use), Prompt, Style, Rewrite prompt, Seed (unique labels, wired LoadImage / LoadAudio)"},"1587":{"id":"/studio-apps-13","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"Occupancy (one GB10 job) — chip at the top of the widget list"},"1588":{"id":"/studio-apps-14","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"Lane A (Inspire) vs Lane B (Produce)"},"1589":{"id":"/studio-apps-15","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"Handoff chains (still → motion → AV)"},"1590":{"id":"/studio-apps-16","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"**What this enables**"},"1591":{"id":"/studio-apps-17","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"Opening a lab graph from Comfy’s **Apps** sidebar, not only Workflows"},"1592":{"id":"/studio-apps-18","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"Queueing a lab graph from creator widgets instead of hunting the canvas"},"1593":{"id":"/studio-apps-19","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"Knowing which App to stop before you load the next one"},"1594":{"id":"/studio-apps-20","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"Following Spark Still → Hero → Silent 5s → AV 5s without renaming files"},"1595":{"id":"/studio-apps-21","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"**Who this is for:** studio users after `stills/still-draft` has been loaded once."},"1596":{"id":"/studio-apps-22","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#comfyui-apps","content":"Lab graphs are the host `_lab/<lane>/*.json` files (folder-scoped ids). On `start` they seed into Comfy as `*.app.json` when App Mode is the default view, so they appear under **Apps** as well as **Workflows**. App Mode is a widget surface on that JSON (ComfyUI frontend &#x2A;*1.41.13+**). It is **not** a second frontend and not `studio-ui`. A small occupancy chip sits at the top of the App widget list (under the menu if you are in graph view) and shows which family is running, still N of M on multi-plate Apps, and the next handoff. It does not cover Run. Restart the container after a pull so `custom_nodes/ez_studio_app` is copied."},"1597":{"id":"/studio-apps-23","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"Surface"},"1598":{"id":"/studio-apps-24","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"What you edit"},"1599":{"id":"/studio-apps-25","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"When"},"1600":{"id":"/studio-apps-26","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"**App**"},"1601":{"id":"/studio-apps-27","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"Unique creator widgets. When the graph needs a still, **Start image** (or **First frame** / **Last frame**) is first so Queue cannot hide a missing file. Then **Quality** (Lab / Draft / High), **Sample prompt** (20 lab recipes + **Custom**), **Prompt**, **Format / platform** (on Apps that own a canvas), **Style** (`none` = off), **Rewrite prompt**, then **Seed**, then Width / Height (and Batch on Klein stills). Format sets pixels and Rewrite prompt framing; Custom uses the size widgets (Klein ÷16, Wan ÷16, LTX ÷32 — pick &#x2A;*LTX · 16:9 YouTube (1280×704)**, never type 720). **Start image** only when that LoadImage is wired (I2V, talking-head, character tweak, clay, text-swap). **motion/av/first-last-12s** exposes **First frame** and **Last frame**. **motion/av/audio-to-video-12s** exposes **Audio file**. Style is hidden on I2V (the start frame owns look). **stills/still-studio** also adds **Look recipe** and Image model — prefix follows Format. **stills/image-studio** adds **Mode category**, **Creator mode** (100 presets), Look recipe, Image model, and an optional example/reference still — prefix follows Creator mode. **stills/still-daily** keeps Image model + steps/CFG. Music adds duration + vocal/instrumental; podcast adds bed length + Kokoro stock voices; **audio/podcast/learn-episode** adds **Sources**, **Format**, and **Duration** (ACE bed stays 30 s and loops); dub adds source file + upload, optional URL, rights, and target language. Duplicate widgets get distinct labels (Klein prompt / Wan prompt, Beat 1 enter, Bed tags)."},"1602":{"id":"/studio-apps-28","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"Daily Queue"},"1603":{"id":"/studio-apps-29","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"**Graph**"},"1604":{"id":"/studio-apps-30","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"Groups, bypass (Ctrl+B), VHS preview, UNET/CLIP/VAE, hidden shot cards, unwired placeholders (Fun InP end frame, VACE shot B), voice-clone refs"},"1605":{"id":"/studio-apps-31","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"Debug, film one-click, unused plates"},"1606":{"id":"/studio-apps-32","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"**Quality** is a workflow-global combo (`EZQuality`) near the top of `linearData` (first on graphs with no required still; second when a LoadImage picker leads). **custom** freezes the last overlay so you can edit widgets without them being overwritten. **lab** restores authored widgets. Named qualities (draft / standard / high / Free Commercial Use / ultra / max) may swap UNET, CLIP, and VAE when those files are on disk. They never change size or length, and Quality is not `--tier quality`. &#x2A;*Free Commercial Use (\\<$10M)** pins Apache Klein 4B (never 9B or FLUX.2-dev) and LTX-2.5 steps; on Klein stills with a generic 16:9 / 9:16 Format it retargets to the LTX feeder size (`1280×704` / `768×1280`). Wan / audio / trellis are no-ops for that choice. ultra/max may select opt-in Non-Commercial weights (gated, not YouTube-ok). Inspire desks (no UNET) still show the combo as a no-op."},"1607":{"id":"/studio-apps-33","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"Official persist is `extra.linearData` (`inputs` / `outputs`). Each input is `[nodeId, widgetName, config?]` with an **integer** node id. ComfyUI frontend &#x2A;*1.49.6+** (the v0.34.6 pin) upgrades that to a live `graphId:nodeId:name` WidgetId at load. Do **not** persist `\"11:prompt\"` two-part ids — the frontend treats a colon as a subgraph locator and drops the widget, leaving App view with Run and occupancy but no Prompt. The lab contract is `extra.lab_app_mode` (`lane`, `occupancy`, `handoff`, `frontend_min`). Do not require `extra.linearMode` — upstream does not write it."},"1608":{"id":"/studio-apps-34","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"Comfy’s **Apps** sidebar lists files whose name ends in `.app.json`. On `start`, the entrypoint seeds every App Mode graph (`default_view: app`) as `_lab/<lane>/*.app.json`. The same stem still appears under **Workflows** in that folder. 90s film graphs stay `default_view: graph` (too many widgets) and keep the `.json` suffix — App Mode is still **enabled**, but they stay Workflows-only. Folders do not add `workflows/apps/`."},"1609":{"id":"/studio-apps-35","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"Filenames: Workflow catalog. Playbook: Still to motion to AV. Restart the container after a pull so the `.app.json` copy runs."},"1610":{"id":"/studio-apps-36","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#graph-vs-app","content":"Save your own Apps under &#x2A;*`_user/`**. A Save that overwrites live `_lab/<lane>/*.app.json` is rescued into `_user/_rescued/` on the next `start`; extras that were never in git move to `_user/`. Re-open the rescued file — `_lab/` is the shipped catalog."},"1611":{"id":"/studio-apps-37","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#occupancy","content":"One GB10 job. Cover art ≠ film ≠ podcast. Every App Note includes a one-line occupancy stanza."},"1612":{"id":"/studio-apps-38","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#occupancy","content":"Occupancy"},"1613":{"id":"/studio-apps-39","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#occupancy","content":"Allowed"},"1614":{"id":"/studio-apps-40","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui","app-mode","workflows","occupancy","klein","wan","ltx"],"type":"text","url":"/studio-apps#occupancy","content":"Must be stopped"},"1615":{"id":"/studio-apps-41","page_id":"/studio-apps","tags":["comfyui"