dio_docs.py` writes `docs/generated/audio/` from Audio Rack JSON. Do not hand-edit those files. The Next export fails closed on MDX/TypeScript errors."},"2135":{"id":"/contribute/testing-docs-49","page_id":"/contribute/testing-docs","tags":["testing","coverage","fumadocs","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/testing-docs#make-docs","content":"Pins: Fumadocs on Next.js 16 (`docs-site/package.json`). Node &#x2A;*22+**. Docs style."},"2136":{"id":"/contribute/testing-docs-50","page_id":"/contribute/testing-docs","tags":["testing","coverage","fumadocs","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/testing-docs#deploy-docsyml","content":"`.github/workflows/deploy-docs.yml&#x60; runs on push to &#x2A;*`main`*&#x2A; / &#x2A;*`development`** (docs paths) or `workflow_dispatch`."},"2137":{"id":"/contribute/testing-docs-51","page_id":"/contribute/testing-docs","tags":["testing","coverage","fumadocs","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/testing-docs#deploy-docsyml","content":"Git branch"},"2138":{"id":"/contribute/testing-docs-52","page_id":"/contribute/testing-docs","tags":["testing","coverage","fumadocs","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/testing-docs#deploy-docsyml","content":"Pages alias"},"2139":{"id":"/contribute/testing-docs-53","page_id":"/contribute/testing-docs","tags":["testing","coverage","fumadocs","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/testing-docs#deploy-docsyml","content":"**`main`**"},"2140":{"id":"/contribute/testing-docs-54","page_id":"/contribute/testing-docs","tags":["testing","coverage","fumadocs","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/testing-docs#deploy-docsyml","content":"**`latest`** (default site)"},"2141":{"id":"/contribute/testing-docs-55","page_id":"/contribute/testing-docs","tags":["testing","coverage","fumadocs","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/testing-docs#deploy-docsyml","content":"**`development`**"},"2142":{"id":"/contribute/testing-docs-56","page_id":"/contribute/testing-docs","tags":["testing","coverage","fumadocs","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/testing-docs#deploy-docsyml","content":"**`development`**"},"2143":{"id":"/contribute/testing-docs-57","page_id":"/contribute/testing-docs","tags":["testing","coverage","fumadocs","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/testing-docs#deploy-docsyml","content":"PR validation is `make docs` in CI only (no Pages push). Each run builds **one** alias and keeps the other from `origin/gh-pages`. Publish uses `scripts/ci/publish-pages-tree.sh` (a separate git worktree) so Next's rewrite of tracked `docs-site/next-env.d.ts` cannot block the `gh-pages` checkout. The helper refuses any file at GitHub's 100 MiB blob limit. Generated encyclopedias are indexed by title, headings, and tags only so the static `/api/search` export stays under that cap. Deploy sets `EZ_DOCS_PUBLISHED_AT` for the last-published chip. `docs-site/lib/site.ts` stamps `development` and GitHub blob/tree URLs to the long-lived ref."},"2144":{"id":"/contribute/testing-docs-58","page_id":"/contribute/testing-docs","tags":["testing","coverage","fumadocs","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/testing-docs#deploy-docsyml","content":"Public URLs: latest · development."},"2145":{"id":"/contribute/testing-docs-59","page_id":"/contribute/testing-docs","tags":["testing","coverage","fumadocs","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/testing-docs#deploy-docsyml","content":"Green `make docs` does not prove the page matches the code. Read `nodes.py` / compose / occupancy before merge."},"2146":{"id":"/create/app-forge","page_id":"/create/app-forge","type":"page","content":"App Forge","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Create"],"tags":["app-forge","studio-mcp","inspire","workflows","mcp"],"url":"/create/app-forge"},"2147":{"id":"/create/app-forge-0","page_id":"/create/app-forge","tags":["app-forge","studio-mcp","inspire","workflows","mcp"],"type":"text","url":"/create/app-forge","content":"Clone a shipped l