y-in-comfy-after-a-blender-dump","content":"Loading clay / depth / canny from `guides/<slug>/<shot>/` without `--install-inputs`"},"3277":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-13","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#stay-in-comfy-after-a-blender-dump","content":"Failing closed when occupancy is still `blender-desk`"},"3278":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-14","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#stay-in-comfy-after-a-blender-dump","content":"Handing a Klein still to TRELLIS.2 INT8 under `output/assets/objects/_lab-mug/`"},"3279":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-15","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#stay-in-comfy-after-a-blender-dump","content":"**Who this is for:** studio users who already dumped a guide pack and want to stay in the ComfyUI canvas."},"3280":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-16","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#stay-in-comfy-after-a-blender-dump","content":"There is **no** live Blender viewport embed. Blender stays on the host. Do not install GeometryPack, Comfy\\_BlenderTools, ComfyBlockout, MixLab, IRCSS, or spawn `blender` from a node."},"3281":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-17","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#operator-loop","content":"Widgets default to `slug=go-see`, `shot_id=12`, `plate=mug`. Depth stays mist 0–1 (near=white, far=black). Do not invert."},"3282":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-18","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#operator-loop","content":"`EZDCCOccupancyGate` reads `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}/.occupancy.json`. It does not `POST /free`, start Compose, or spawn Blender. Missing file passes (mode `unknown`). `blender-desk` vs Klein / LTX / Wan / TRELLIS **fails** — park is for dumps."},"3283":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-19","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#graphs-_labdcc","content":"Graph"},"3284":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-20","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#graphs-_labdcc","content":"Occupancy"},"3285":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-21","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#graphs-_labdcc","content":"What it does"},"3286":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-22","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#graphs-_labdcc","content":"**dcc/guide-still**"},"3287":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-23","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#graphs-_labdcc","content":"klein"},"3288":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-24","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#graphs-_labdcc","content":"Gate + `EZDCCLoadGuideStill(first)` → Klein 4B edit. 1280×704. Seed 42. Prefix `ez_guide_hero`"},"3289":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-25","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#graphs-_labdcc","content":"**dcc/depth-from-loader**"},"3290":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-26","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#graphs-_labdcc","content":"ltx"},"3291":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-27","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#graphs-_labdcc","content":"Gate + still + `depth.mp4` path. Envelope only (Templates → Union Control). MagCache off. Distilled-only. Prefix `ez_iclora_guide`"},"3292":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-28","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#graphs-_labdcc","content":"**dcc/still-to-mesh**"},"3293":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-29","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#graphs-_labdcc","content":"trellis"},"3294":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-30","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#graphs-_labdcc","content":"Gate + still pack `plate=mug` → native TRELLIS.2 INT8. Output `assets/objects/_lab-mug/` under `output/`"},"3295":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-31","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#graphs-_labdcc","content":"The original seven DCC graphs stay on `LoadImage` + `--install-inputs`. After a dump you can keep using those, or stay on `:8188` with the loaders."},"3296":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-32","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#path-d-default-on-one-gb10","content":"Laptop dump → rsync `guides/` → Spark Comfy. Spark does not run Blender."},"3297":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-33","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#path-d-default-on-one-gb10","content":"Pack contract and print modes: DCC guide pack. Occupancy XOR: Occupancy desk. Stills vs 5.00s: Blender creator suite."},"3298":{"id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender-34","page_id":"/learn/comfy-first-blender","tags":["learn","blender","dcc","comfyui","occupancy","klein","ltx","trellis"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfy-first-blender#path-d-default-on-one-gb10","content":"No Blender in Docker. No GeometryPack / Comfy\\_BlenderTools / ComfyBlockout / MixLab / IRCSS. No Pixal3D, nvdiffrast, Flux Dev, or 19B Union. No `asset-new`. TRELLIS stays opt-in `download-3d --tier trellis2`."},"3299":{"id":"/learn/comfyui","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","type":"page","content":"ComfyUI basics","breadcrumbs":["Docs","How the studio works"],"tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"url":"/learn/comfyui"},"3300":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-0","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui","content":"Node graphs, Nodes 2.0, widgets, Queue, seeds, and where PNG/MP4 files land in the US-safe studio."},"3301":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-1","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","type":"heading","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"url":"/learn/comfyui#comfyui-basics","content":"ComfyUI basics"},"3302":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-2","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","type":"heading","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"url":"/learn/comfyui#a-graph-not-a-chat-box","content":"A graph, not a chat box"},"3303":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-3","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","type":"heading","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"url":"/learn/comfyui#nodes-20","content":"Nodes 2.0"},"3304":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-4","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","type":"heading","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"url":"/learn/comfyui#graph-and-app","content":"Graph and App"},"3305":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-5","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","type":"heading","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"url":"/learn/comfyui#how-a-lab-graph-shows-up","content":"How a lab graph shows up"},"3306":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-6","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","type":"heading","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"url":"/learn/comfyui#queue-seed-batch","content":"Queue, seed, batch"},"3307":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-7","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","type":"heading","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"url":"/learn/comfyui#inputs-and-outputs","content":"Inputs and outputs"},"3308":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-8","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","type":"heading","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"url":"/learn/comfyui#missing-models-is-a-cache-problem","content":"Missing Models is a cache problem"},"3309":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-9","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","type":"heading","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"url":"/learn/comfyui#laptop-access","content":"Laptop access"},"3310":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-10","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#comfyui-basics","content":"**What's on this page**"},"3311":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-11","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#comfyui-basics","content":"Node graph vs App Mode (same JSON, creator widgets)"},"3312":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-12","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#comfyui-basics","content":"Nodes 2.0 (Vue renderer) as the default canvas"},"3313":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-13","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#comfyui-basics","content":"How lab workflows get onto the canvas (Workflows and Apps)"},"3314":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-14","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#comfyui-basics","content":"Queue, seed, widgets, Note node"},"3315":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-15","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#comfyui-basics","content":"Where outputs go, and what “Missing Models” actually means"},"3316":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-16","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#comfyui-basics","content":"**What this enables**"},"3317":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-17","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#comfyui-basics","content":"Using the studio without editing JSON"},"3318":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-18","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#comfyui-basics","content":"Mapping every Create-page instruction onto a thing you can click"},"3319":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-19","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#comfyui-basics","content":"**Who this is for:** first hour in the UI after `manage.sh start`."},"3320":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-20","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#a-graph-not-a-chat-box","content":"ComfyUI is a **node graph**. Each box is a step (load weights, encode text, sample, decode, save). Wires carry images, latents, and strings. You do not type a prompt into a single streaming chat field and hope — you change **widgets** on the nodes the lab already wired. **inspire/research-chat** is still that graph: one **Message** widget, then Queue (occupancy **llm**). It is not Comfy Cloud’s In-App Agent."},"3321":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-21","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#a-graph-not-a-chat-box","content":"Daily rule: &#x2A;*do not edit raw `_lab` JSON.** Open the graph, change widgets, Queue."},"3322":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-22","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#nodes-20","content":"The studio canvas uses Nodes 2.0 (Vue DOM nodes, not LiteGraph canvas drawing). `start` writes `Comfy.VueNodes.Enabled` and `Comfy.VueNodes.AutoScaleLayout` into `user/default/comfy.settings.json` **only when those keys are absent** — an operator who already toggled Nodes 2.0 off keeps that choice. Lab graphs stamp `extra.workflowRendererVersion&#x60; as &#x2A;*`Vue-corrected`** so coordinates stay LiteGraph-canonical; do **not** stamp `\"Vue\"` or the frontend shrinks the layout by 1.2×. Shipped node positions already leave room for Vue widget height (Enhance, CLIP, LoadImage, KSampler) so Auto-scale does not stack boxes."},"3323":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-23","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#nodes-20","content":"Toggle from the Comfy logo menu or Settings. Classic LiteGraph still loads the same JSON."},"3324":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-24","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#graph-and-app","content":"The same JSON can open as a **graph** (nodes and wires) or as an **App** (creator widgets only). App Mode is official from ComfyUI frontend **1.41.13** (this stack pins **1.49.6**). Lab graphs stamp `extra.linearData` as `[nodeId, widgetName, config]` plus `extra.lab_app_mode` so **Quality** (Lab / Draft / High), **Sample prompt**, **Prompt**, **Style**, **Rewrite prompt**, and **Seed** show first in the App panel. Pick a lab recipe or **Custom** to type your own. **Start image** appears only when that LoadImage is wired (I2V / character tweak / clay). Style is a dropdown (`none` = off) and is hidden on I2V — the start frame owns look. Size and UNET stay hidden except on **klein-still-daily**, **stills/still-studio**, and **stills/image-studio** (Format / platform also sets size; image-studio also exposes Creator mode). Multi-shot Apps expose one identity prompt — not ten shot cards. Duplicate widgets get unique labels (Klein / Wan / LTX on Prompt Forge; Beat 1 enter on the beat sheet). 90s films stay in graph view. Occupancy is a chip at the top of the widget list, not over Run. This is **not** `studio-ui` and not a second product. See ComfyUI Apps."},"3325":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-25","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#how-a-lab-graph-shows-up","content":"On `start`, the entrypoint rsyncs shipped JSON into Comfy’s `user/default/workflows/_lab/<lane>/` (directory-preserving; `--delete` is scoped to `_lab/` only). Prefer host `workflows/_lab/` when present; otherwise map the current flat repo globs into those lanes. App Mode graphs (`default_view: app`) land as `_lab/<lane>/*.app.json` so they show in the **Apps** sidebar as well as **Workflows**. 90s films stay `*.json&#x60; (graph default). Save your own graphs under &#x2A;*`_user/`** — start never deletes or overwrites that folder. If you Save in `_lab/` anyway, start **rescues** extras into `_user/` and edited lab graphs into `_user/_rescued/`, then restores the git catalog in `_lab/`. Re-open the rescued copy; do not keep editing `_lab/`."},"3326":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-26","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#how-a-lab-graph-shows-up","content":"Open `http://${SPARK_HOST}:${COMFY_PORT}` (port-forward from a laptop if needed)"},"3327":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-27","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#how-a-lab-graph-shows-up","content":"Load **stills/still-draft** from **Apps** or **Workflows**"},"3328":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-28","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#how-a-lab-graph-shows-up","content":"Read the on-canvas **Note node** — purpose, models, sampler, prompting, run steps"},"3329":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-29","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#how-a-lab-graph-shows-up","content":"Queue"},"3330":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-30","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#how-a-lab-graph-shows-up","content":"If the graph is missing, restart the container so the copy runs. YAML shot lists stay on the host; they are not copied."},"3331":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-31","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#queue-seed-batch","content":"Control"},"3332":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-32","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#queue-seed-batch","content":"Meaning"},"3333":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-33","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#queue-seed-batch","content":"**Queue**"},"3334":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-34","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#queue-seed-batch","content":"Run the graph once (encode → sample → decode → save)"},"3335":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-35","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#queue-seed-batch","content":"**seed**"},"3336":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-36","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#queue-seed-batch","content":"RNG lock. Same seed + same graph ≈ same picture"},"3337":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-37","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#queue-seed-batch","content":"**batch**"},"3338":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-38","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#queue-seed-batch","content":"How many stills in one Queue (draft Klein uses 2)"},"3339":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-39","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#queue-seed-batch","content":"**Bypass**"},"3340":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-40","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#queue-seed-batch","content":"Skip a group (Ctrl+B) without deleting it"},"3341":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-41","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#queue-seed-batch","content":"A still-draft Queue is the “hello world” of this studio. A one-click 90s film Queue is **long** because it runs 18 sequential 5 s prints — that is expected, not a hang."},"3342":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-42","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#queue-seed-batch","content":"Fix the seed when you iterate a prompt. Randomize when you are exploring."},"3343":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-43","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#inputs-and-outputs","content":"`SaveImage` writes PNG under `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}` (container `/outputs`). Draft prefix `ez_still_draft`. Hero prefix `ez_still_hero`."},"3344":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-44","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#inputs-and-outputs","content":"`VHS_VideoCombine` writes MP4. After Queue, open **Save video (MP4) — open node for preview**. LTX also muxes decoded audio into that MP4."},"3345":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-45","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#inputs-and-outputs","content":"Set **LoadImage** to the PNG you like (`ez_still_draft_*.png`). Leaving Comfy’s `example.png` only smoke-tests the graph."},"3346":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-46","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#inputs-and-outputs","content":"`cleanup` does **not** delete `COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR`. `status` prints the path."},"3347":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-47","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#missing-models-is-a-cache-problem","content":"If the canvas says **Missing Models**, the JSON is fine and the **weights** are not on `MODELS_DIR` (or the `comfy/` symlink is broken). Re-run `./scripts/manage.sh download-models`, then `doctor`. Do not rewrite the graph to “fix” a missing file."},"3348":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-48","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#missing-models-is-a-cache-problem","content":"Prompt Enhance missing? Restart so `custom_nodes/ez_prompt_enhance` is copied. Enhance is fail-soft: generation still runs without the GGUF. Creative Research missing with `IMPORT FAILED` / `No module named 'ez_prompt_enhance'`, or LTX snap missing with `IMPORT FAILED: …/ez_ltx_spatial` / `No module named 'ez_film'`, is the same restart after this pack load fix — Comfy 0.34 does not import sibling packs by folder name."},"3349":{"id":"/learn/comfyui-49","page_id":"/learn/comfyui","tags":["learn","comfyui","queue","workflow","studio"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/comfyui#laptop-access","content":"Next: Image and video generation · Getting Started if the stack is not up yet."},"3350":{"id":"/learn/dream-house","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","type":"page","content":"Dream-house tours","breadcrumbs":["Docs","How the studio works"],"tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"url":"/learn/dream-house"},"3351":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-0","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house","content":"Two Instagram 4:5 virtual tours of one place — language-locked T2I, or a Blender greybox that Klein restyles."},"3352":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-1","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","type":"heading","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"url":"/learn/dream-house#dream-house-tours","content":"Dream-house tours"},"3353":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-2","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","type":"heading","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"Two doors"},"3354":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-3","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","type":"heading","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"url":"/learn/dream-house#clay-loop","content":"Clay loop"},"3355":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-4","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","type":"heading","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"url":"/learn/dream-house#skip-rules","content":"Skip rules"},"3356":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-5","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","type":"heading","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"url":"/learn/dream-house#occupancy","content":"Occupancy"},"3357":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-6","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#dream-house-tours","content":"**What's on this page**"},"3358":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-7","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#dream-house-tours","content":"Two doors to a ten-still Instagram 4:5 walkthrough"},"3359":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-8","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#dream-house-tours","content":"When to use language persistence vs a 3D greybox"},"3360":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-9","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#dream-house-tours","content":"Occupancy: stop Comfy before a Blender `house-views` dump (`--install-inputs` / `--seed-inputs` may run while Comfy is up)"},"3361":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-10","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#dream-house-tours","content":"`start` seeds LoadImage plates so the clay App can Queue without a dump"},"3362":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-11","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#dream-house-tours","content":"**What this enables**"},"3363":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-12","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#dream-house-tours","content":"Keeping **stills/dream-house** as a one-Queue language tour"},"3364":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-13","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#dream-house-tours","content":"Using a real 3D scene so rooms stay adjacent while Klein only paints materials"},"3365":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-14","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#dream-house-tours","content":"**Who this is for:** studio users who already Queued the T2I dream-house and want the rooms to share a floorplan."},"3366":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-15","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"The T2I tour remembers the place in prose (`HOUSE IDENTITY` + Prompt Join `lock=view`). The clay tour remembers it as geometry: Blender dumps ten Workbench stills from named cameras, then Klein **edit** restyles each plate."},"3367":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-16","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"Graph"},"3368":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-17","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"Persistence"},"3369":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-18","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"When"},"3370":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-19","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"**stills/dream-house**"},"3371":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-20","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"Prompt Join `lock=view`. Independent T2I"},"3372":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-21","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"No Blender, or you want a one-Queue draft"},"3373":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-22","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"**stills/dream-house-clay**"},"3374":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-23","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"One greybox + ten cameras. Klein edit + `ReferenceLatent`"},"3375":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-24","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"You want the kitchen to stay next to the lounge. `start` seeds plates; Blender dump is optional Workbench quality"},"3376":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-25","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"Same ten cameras (tower, foyer, lounge, kitchen, dining, bedroom, bath, terrace, drone, study). Same 1024×1280 Instagram 4:5. Same optional style dropdown on the bible. Prefixes do **not** collide. Language-tour shot cards are walkthrough cameras (lens, height, a distinct room program, near/far, which room); type the place — materials, time of day, architecture — in **HOUSE IDENTITY**. Each still names its own room (entrance hall, living hall, cook line, dining hall, sleep chamber, wet room, open-air terrace, writing room) so a Queue reads as a tour, not one volume with different finishes."},"3377":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-26","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"TRELLIS.2 is a hero-piece tool, not a walkable house. Do not TRELLIS a full-scene still and expect a foyer. Godot is P2 — `house-views` is Blender only."},"3378":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-27","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#clay-loop","content":"`manage.sh start` seeds `ez_house_clay_01.png` … `10.png` into `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}/input` (container `/inputs`) so LoadImage can Queue. If a `house-views` pack already exists it is copied; otherwise the shipped `schemas/house_layout.yaml` cameras are rendered (no Blender). Reload the App if it was open before seed."},"3379":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-28","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#clay-loop","content":"Optional Workbench dump (higher quality) — host Blender, then park or stop Comfy:"},"3380":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-29","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#clay-loop","content":"Dump lives under `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}/assets/sets/<slug>/` (layout, `mesh/house.glb`, `views/`, `depth/`). Clay copies `ez_house_clay_01.png` … `10.png` land in that folder and in `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}/input`. LoadImage does **not** list the output root."},"3381":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-30","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#clay-loop","content":"Already dumped but Clay 01–10 show **Missing Inputs** / “no file selected”? Copy or reseed without Blender (compose may stay up), then reload the graph:"},"3382":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-31","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#clay-loop","content":"Default layout is `schemas/house_layout.yaml` (lab penthouse matching the canned bible). `--layout` overrides. v1 does not invent a unique floorplan from prose."},"3383":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-32","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#skip-rules","content":"If"},"3384":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-33","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#skip-rules","content":"Skip"},"3385":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-34","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#skip-rules","content":"No host Blender"},"3386":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-35","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#skip-rules","content":"Workbench dump. `start` / `--seed-inputs` still render layout cameras. Language-only tour → **stills/dream-house**. Do not substitute T2I stills or `example.png` as clay"},"3387":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-36","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#skip-rules","content":"Compose is up"},"3388":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-37","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#skip-rules","content":"Blender `house-views` dump (exit 2). `./scripts/manage.sh stop` first. `--install-inputs` and `--seed-inputs` may run while compose is up"},"3389":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-38",