ckup-restore-16","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#backup-and-restore","content":"Stores: Architecture · Models and cache."},"3632":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-17","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#backup-and-restore","content":"`./scripts/manage.sh cleanup` (type **DELETE*&#x2A;) removes named volume &#x2A;*`ez-comfy-state`** only — Comfy install, venv, lab `ez_*` copies. It does **not** delete `${MODELS_DIR}` or `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}`. Do **not** run `docker system prune -a --volumes`. Do **not** `rm -rf` `${MODELS_DIR}` unless you intend to re-download tens of GB (throttled wrap). `reap-models` and `disk-wizard&#x60; default to &#x2A;*`--plan`**."},"3633":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-18","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"Tree"},"3634":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-19","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"Holds"},"3635":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-20","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"Notes"},"3636":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-21","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"**`${MODELS_DIR}`** (default `/mnt/models`)"},"3637":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-22","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","con